      "writtenOn": "2026-07-29T16:51:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it that is necessary to mention about filesystem (it is implied that different filesystems have different performance.). That being said a single write shouldn\u0027t be that costly. I didn\u0027t notice any major time difference in change creation in my testing.",
